# Crypto-trader — Project Context

Adaptive algorithmic trading system for **Delta Exchange India**. Detects market regimes, selects from 7 strategies via a meta-selector, enforces risk limits, and learns from rolling performance.

## Modes

| Mode | Command | Description |
|------|---------|-------------|
| Paper | `python main.py paper` | Testnet, simulated orders |
| Live | `python main.py run` | Production engine |
| Dashboard | `python main.py dashboard` | Web UI only |
| Trade | `python main.py trade` | Dashboard + engine |

## Key Entry Points

| File | Role |
|------|------|
| [main.py](main.py) | CLI (Click) |
| [src/core/engine.py](src/core/engine.py) | Trading orchestrator |
| [src/dashboard/app.py](src/dashboard/app.py) | FastAPI web UI |
| [src/execution/exchange.py](src/execution/exchange.py) | Delta REST client |
| [src/strategies/selector.py](src/strategies/selector.py) | Strategy registry + selection |

## Strategies (7)

- **Trend:** EMA crossover, Supertrend, Donchian
- **Mean reversion:** RSI reversion, Bollinger
- **Momentum:** MACD
- **Breakout:** Volume breakout

## Configuration

- `config/settings.yaml` — exchange URLs, engine timing, universe
- `config/risk.yaml` — position sizing, limits, circuit breakers
- `config/strategies.yaml` — strategy params and selector config
- `.env` — `DELTA_API_KEY`, `DELTA_API_SECRET`, `TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN`, `TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID`

## External Services

- **Delta Exchange India** — REST + WebSocket (prod + testnet)
- **Telegram Bot API** — trade alerts, circuit breaker notifications

## Default Risk Assumptions

2% per trade, 5% daily loss halt, 15% max drawdown, 5x max leverage, 3 max open positions.
